[00:15.122]When everything falls and all comes crashing down
{"当万物崩塌　一切轰然倾覆"}
[00:21.245]When you're too tired to see through the mess you left before you
{"当你疲惫不堪　看不清自己留下的残局"}
[00:27.217]When you have lost your way and your hope cannot be found
{"当你迷失方向　希望无处可寻"}
[00:33.351]And you come to the conclusion that dreaming is the most you can do
{"当你终于明白　做梦已是竭尽所能"}
[00:46.920]But it's still a long way to go so hold on
{"但前路依旧漫长　所以请坚持住"}
[00:57.538]Because today so now you find a flower in the snow
{"因为此刻　你在雪中发现一朵花"}
[01:05.458]And it may never wander away
{"它或许永远不会凋零飘散"}
[01:10.191]The boy in your eyes
{"你眼中的少年"}
[01:14.326]It tells you which way to go
{"会为你指明方向"}
[01:17.972]If setting tools for a rainy day
{"若未雨绸缪"}
[01:20.952]Tomorrow's a brighter day
{"明天会是更晴朗的一天"}
[02:13.445]Please get on now
{"现在就启程吧"}
[02:50.080]Where's that down
{"低落情绪何处寻"}
[03:32.728]OPEN YOUR MIND
{"敞开心扉"}
[06:56.445]Because today so now you find a flower in the snow
{"因为此刻　你在雪中发现一朵花"}
[07:05.283]In the snow
{"在雪中"}
[07:07.646]And it may never wander away
{"它或许永远不会凋零飘散"}
